  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Call transfer\"\nslug: \"/apps/desktop-call-transfer--goxhybvy8g83rnreyy2bsadr\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Desktop\",\"General\",\"desktop\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[Android](/docs/apps/android-transfer-call--ukk2ikysb3a6guqd8gzugh87) *or&#x20;*[iOS](/docs/apps/ios-transfer-a-call--fi98bkz81m665tyvhwu8p13p) *version of this article?*\n\n## Blind transfer\n\nTo transfer a call:\n\n1. Click the **Transfer&#x20;**&#x69;con![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/2fcd644d306a1713c1d3/f7b680ab582ff357c4dd29238083c600ad7fadf4ee16657c32f33701d52cf05d.png)on a [Call panel or Pop-up window](/docs/apps/desktop-call-hold-dtmf-recording--ybm4k618ragnlgyy963xbwpe) .\n\n**OR**\n\n1. Click on the menu icon![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/7c10737329d19d59e3b4/6c4a75a00c5a57de9bded1029d1a4493fc8c2d6b76f174e4f44f4d38ed45f528.png)of an [Active Line](/docs/apps/desktop-call-hold-dtmf-recording--ybm4k618ragnlgyy963xbwpe) and select **Transfer&#x20;**&#x66;rom the drop-down menu.\n2. Choose a contact you want to transfer a call to from the list or enter a new phone number in a **Search field&#x20;**&#x61;nd click on the **Blind transfer&#x20;**&#x69;con.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/510820b95d2f6a9c0b89/a994894570060a0dd8bcf484b68284a045485dd00f79193ada8f7ec3ed67db19.png)\n\n## Attended (warm) transfer\n\nTo make an attended (warm) transfer:\n\n1. Follow steps 1 and 2 like for Blind Transfer but press the **Attended transfer&#x20;**&#x62;utton instead.\n\nAn additional active panel will appear for the second active call while the first active call will be put on hold automatically.\n\n1. Click on the **Transfer&#x20;**&#x62;utton at **Active Line&#x20;**&#x6F;r **Pop-up window**.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/dde671572b30143693c1/df5d28c9c5b5bbd995ccddfb7c5efdae2dbd4a2033115bff7c59b09c483ae12c.png)\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/35fd09664c0961baac18/e50877a1884a2ca85630f375982e97d25f5d88953603d54867e38c8ecb4f2cea.png)\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/f1d40fdc8f8cbde30b70/b7626c31c270b6eda8529f58a1ab498ef30fc95f163424ce18628de1604366cd.png)\n\n## Alternatively\n\nYou can also transfer a call in the following way:\n\n1. During an active call, initiate a new [outgoing call](/docs/apps/desktop-outgoing-call--te63hnixsyugdk7wpsw59xeq) . The current call will be placed on hold automatically.\n2. Click on the **Transfer&#x20;**&#x62;utton at [Active Line or Pop-up window](/docs/apps/desktop-call-hold-dtmf-recording--ybm4k618ragnlgyy963xbwpe) .\n"
